// The phrases of `{ … }` are evaluated against the same state and their effects merged, creation first.
Fact performed Identified by A, B, C
Event a Creates performed(A) When Not(performed(A))
Event b Creates performed(B) When performed(A)
Event c Creates performed(C) When performed(B).
{ a. b. c. }
?performed(A). ?!performed(B).
{ a. b. c. -performed }
?performed(B). ?!performed(A).
